                                "sense_id": "1a613b3d-c665-3da1-a31c-c50bcaf70965",
                                "text": "\"Naw, no trouble. Just pulled off the road for about ten minutes, maybe, when a couple of Nip fighters banked overhead. They were after something or other.\" \"Is that right?\" Mac replied."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "8b5734a5-9739-4609-8c15-9a41b039adf5",
                                "sense_id": "1a613b3d-c665-3da1-a31c-c50bcaf70965",
                                "text": "'Naw, hen, sorry. Ye're too young for us. Come back when you've got a couple mair years under yer belt, eh?'"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "9af683e0-70c7-4a1f-9bbc-bb58269effc9",
                                "sense_id": "1a613b3d-c665-3da1-a31c-c50bcaf70965",
                                "text": "“Naw, no thanks. I'll catch you next time.” “Come on, Shane. All you do is work, work, and work. You need to have a little fun, don't you?” “Right now, I'm having a lot of fun. Trust me.” “Do you have company?” “No, I'm painting.”"
                            }
